<title>USA: Novametrix proposal to issue shrs defeated.</title>
<headline>Novametrix proposal to issue shrs defeated.</headline>
<dateline>WALLINGFORD, Conn. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novametrix Medical Systems Inc said Monday that a preliminary count of proxies indicated that the proposal to issue shares of common stock as part of the merger agreement with Andros Holdings Inc was defeated.</p>
<p>The proxies were submitted at its recent annual meeting.</p>
<p>No determination has been made on the validity of the proxies submitted, and depending on the official outcome, the company said it was studying its options.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
